		{
			description: [
				"Now we begin the work properly."
				""
				"Petals and Dreamwood in the basin, and what comes out is a thread that is still, faintly, alive. Make a great many. Everything above this rests on it."
				""
				"From here each era asks two more steps than the last. Three now. Five in the next. Seventeen by the end. I am telling you so that you can build for it rather than be surprised by it."
			]
			id: "150F2BE3592ED1B9"
