		{
			description: [
				"The Hydroangeas makes mana out of water. It is early, it is cheap, and every new player builds a wall of them."
				""
				"It is a dead end on purpose. The rate is poor, it consumes the water, and the hours you spend scaling it are hours not spent on a generating flower that would have paid ten times over."
				""
				"Build one to see it work. Then build something else."
			]
			id: "513441D8D9FE2BB4"
			optional: true
