		{
			description: [
				"In every other telling, Elementium is what you trade for."
				""
				"Here it is in the ground. You will mine it, and the elves you read about in Midgard's books would have considered that obscene wealth."
				""
				"What you cannot get is Manasteel without work, and Mana Diamonds at all until the gate opens. Remember which way round this world runs."
