		{
			description: [
				"The Enchanting Apparatus reads the pedestals around it, and their arrangement is part of what you are making."
				""
				"This is the Song's whole character in one block: you build the working in the world rather than typing it into a grid. It is slower and it is why the tradition feels like a craft."
