		}
		{
			description: [
				"You have drawn on this land for two eras. Here is how you give it back."
				""
				"Ancient trees restore aura to the chunk they grow in, slowly, and they are the only thing in this pack that does."
				""
				"The Ashen Grove is what happens when nobody plants for three hundred years. You are standing in the argument."
			]
			id: "753573370987806B"
			optional: true
