		}
		{
			description: [
				"A Foliot will carry, crush or trade, forever, with no power and no upkeep."
				""
				"Every other automation in this pack has a running cost. This one does not, and that is the whole reason the tradition exists and the whole reason the Court disapproves of it."
				""
				"I have taught you how. I have not told you to."
