		{
			dependencies: ["2C4971B3AC935AD3"]
			description: [
				"Two refined, a pearl, and elf glass, on the runic altar."
				""
				"This is the finished thing, and I want to be exact about what you have made. It is not a power source. It holds nothing. Set it on a table and it will sit there for a thousand years being violet."
				""
				"What it is, is *unattached*. Every other material in this world already belongs to a system -- mana is Botania's, source is the Ars-wrights', essence belongs to whatever answers when the Occultists knock. This belongs to none of them, which means it can become any of them."
			]
